# Configuration. No secrets in here today — VITE_ values are compiled into
# the bundle and are public by the time anyone loads the page — but it is
# still per-deployment, and the same rule as every other service in this
# system: .env reaches the deployment from the host, never from the repo.
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
